{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c53d","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0a8de-e22e-70a3-89be-ab44c7c44c24"},"sequence":249,"recorded_at":1780531400000493,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"6ff73b13-a72a-4314-9fa1-56166ffd9a91","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"6ff73b13-a72a-4314-9fa1-56166ffd9a91","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"6ff73b13-a72a-4314-9fa1-56166ffd9a91"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0a8df-78c1-71d2-817f-d0632c66c3cc"},"task_id":"01a0a8df-78c1-71d2-817f-d0632c66c3cc","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0a8df-78c1-71d2-817f-d0632c66c3cc","chunk":"Read text file `/Users/iv/Documents/Codex/2026-09-15/new-chat-4/outputs/RunnerControl/.task-board/.resources/TASK-260916-13diw4/TASK-260916-13diw4_outcome_v4.md`.\n1|# TASK-260916-13diw4: register-mac-and-repository-access — developer outcome v4\n2|\n3|Status: ready for review (board `to-review`, uncommitted candidate in story worktree).\n4|\n5|This run fixes ALL THREE revision-3 findings (R3-F1…R3-F3,\n6|`changes_requested`, `repeat-of: revision 2 / R2-F3` for R3-F1/R3-F3 and\n7|`repeat-of: revision 2 / R2-F2` for R3-F2) as one coherent\n8|operation-identity/lifecycle change, adopting the reviewer's exact attack\n9|source as committed named regressions, plus the mid-run directive class\n10|(selection edits during their own mutation). Prior M1–M20 regions were not\n11|rerun per the revision-4 contract (unchanged code); the M9 survivor bound is\n12|restated from v3.\n13|\n14|## Fixes (code)\n15|\n16|1. **R3-F1 — in-flight completion restores stale progress (repeat-of R2-F3).**\n17|   New `OperationIdentity` (server + scope + install dir + runner name +\n18|   work folder + group) in Models. `Flow.beginDraft`/`updateDraft` bump\n19|   `generation` and clear `working`/`workingStep` when an identity edit lands\n20|   while working, emitting `draftBegan`/`draftUpdated` + `cancelled` so State\n21|   clears `working`. Every step captures `gen` and checks `isStale` after each\n22|   await; stale completions emit nothing. Already-started filesystem/network\n23|   side effects stay on disk/remote for safe recovery; only completion\n24|   ownership is revoked. Reducer mirrors invalidation (including group→runner\n25|   demotion) and `draftBegan` now clears progress. Page names the cancel rule.\n26|2. **R3-F2 — server absent from authorization (repeat-of R2-F2/rev1-F5).**\n27|   `verifiedLocalAgentID` and `scopeMatches` now require `serverHost` with\n28|   `www.github.com`⇔`github.com` normalization; a same-path foreign host never\n29|   matches. Every step loads one auth, `syncServerBinding` drops\n30|   server-bound caches (group/asset/runnerID/pendings) on session change, and\n31|   the same auth serves the whole step (no mid-step reload mixing servers).\n32|   Group ownership is keyed by server+org+name. Register/labels/service verify\n33|   `.runner` host against the session server before any remote write or resume.\n34|3. **R3-F3 — changed work folder reuses old success (repeat-of R2-F3).**\n35|   `verifiedLocalAgentID` now checks `workFolder`; the configured marker\n36|   records `serverHost`+`groupName` (`.runner` omits group) and\n37|   `verifyConfiguredGroup` refuses cross-group resume including pre-recording\n38|   markers. `runConfig` resume verifies full identity instead of returning a\n39|   stale ID. Group edits invalidate registration evidence in Flow and reducer.\n40|4. **Directive — selection edits during their own mutation (R3-F1 class).**\n41|   `workingStep` tracking; `shouldAbandonInFlight` abandons in-flight\n42|   `applyLabels` on labels edits and `applyRepositoryAccess` on repository\n43|   edits, so an older completion can never overwrite the newer visible\n44|   selection or report it as applied. Labels/repos stay editable without\n45|   cancelling unrelated steps (install/register/group).\n46|\n47|## AC coverage — 8 of 8 rows driven through production entry points\n48|\n49|| # | AC row | Named committed test(s) | Production call site |\n50||---|--------|-------------------------|----------------------|\n51|| 1 | Org registration without terminal | `orgWizardEndToEndDeletesTokenAndLeaksNothing`, `reviewerInFlightInstallCannotRepopulateChangedDraft` | `Flow.apply` (.beginDraft/.resolveGroup/.downloadAndInstall/.registerRunner/.setupService) |\n52|| 2 | Repo registration without terminal | `repoWizardOmitsRunnerGroup`, `repoRunnerListRequestUsesQueryNotEncodedPath` | same Flow effects; no `runner-groups` traffic, no `--runnergroup` argv |\n53|| 3 | Selected repos are applied | `orgResolveGroupCreatesWithSelectedRepos`, `repoAccessAppliesAndConfirmsRealIDs`, `repositoryConfirmationFollowsPagination`, `inFlightAccessAbandonedWhenRepositoriesEdited` (recovery) | `createGroup` / `setGroupRepositories` + paginated `fetchGroupRepositories` confirm |\n54|| 4 | Repo access and labels changeable | `repoAccessAppliesAndConfirmsRealIDs`, `labelsApplyRequiresRealRunnerIDThenPuts`, `inFlightLabelsAbandonedWhenLabelsEdited` (recovery) | `Flow.apply(.applyRepositoryAccess/.applyLabels)` with verified IDs |\n55|| 5 | Failed ops avoid orphans | `failedConfigDeletesTokenAndReportsScrubbedError`, `registerIsIdempotentAcrossRetries`, `registerRefusesMismatchedRemoteIdentity` | `Flow.registerRunner` (token deleted on every failure path; single mint/config) |\n56|| 6 | Repeated ops avoid duplicates | `registerIsIdempotentAcrossRetries`, `retryResumesFailedDownloadWithoutDuplicates`, `remoteDuplicateWithoutReplaceIsRefusedBeforeToken`, `runnerListFollowsPaginationForDuplicateGuard`, `existingRegistrationBlocksFreshInstall` | complete-list `rejectRemoteDuplicate` gate + installer markers |\n57|| 7 | No secret leakage | `orgWizardEndToEndDeletesTokenAndLeaksNothing`, `runConfigScrubsTokenFromFailure`, `failedConfigDeletesTokenAndReportsScrubbedError` | token only in config.sh argv in memory; absent from actions/URLs/headers/bodies; deleted after use |\n58|| 8 | Tests exercise actual entry points | all Flow tests + `setupServiceWritesManualPlistFoundByDiscovery`, `runConfigExecutesRealScript`, `runConfigRefusesWorkFolderMismatchOnResume`, `scopeChangeClearsCompletedStepsInState` | `Flow.apply`, `RunnerInstallerService.*`, `State.reduce`, cross-checked by `RunnerDiscovery.installed` and a real shell `config.sh` |\n59|\n60|Negative/refusal coverage (each fails when the gate admits what it must\n61|reject): all v3 negatives retained and green, plus the three adopted reviewer\n62|attacks, `inFlightRegistrationCannotAttributeOldConfigToNewDraft`,\n63|`inFlightGroupCannotResolveForEditedDraft`,\n64|`inFlightLabelsCannotWriteForEditedDraft`,\n65|`nonIdentityEditDuringInstallDoesNotCancel` (non-cancellation control),\n66|`serverChangeBetweenStepsInvalidatesGroupAndRunner`,\n67|`groupOwnershipIsScopedToServer`,\n68|`enterpriseGroupDoesNotReuseGithubOwnership`,\n69|`groupChangeRefusesOldConfiguredSuccess`,\n70|`runConfigRefusesWorkFolderMismatchOnResume`,\n71|`inFlightLabelsAbandonedWhenLabelsEdited`,\n72|`inFlightAccessAbandonedWhenRepositoriesEdited`, and the extended\n73|`verifiedLocalAgentIDRefusesEachMismatchClass` (foreign-server + work-folder\n74|members) and `operationIdentityNormalizationAndChangeDetection` pins.\n75|\n76|## Narrowing-mutant evidence (this run, each reverted pristine via `cmp`)\n77|\n78|New/changed gates only (M1–M20 unchanged regions not rerun per contract):\n79|\n80|| Mutant | Admits exactly | Named failing test(s) | Result |\n81||--------|----------------|-----------------------|--------|\n82|| M21: `identityFieldsChanged` skips name check | renamed-runner in-flight members only | `inFlightRegistrationCannotAttributeOldConfigToNewDraft` (3 issues: stale 4242/registered), `inFlightLabelsCannotWriteForEditedDraft` (2 issues: PUT+applied), `operationIdentityNormalizationAndChangeDetection` (1 issue) | KILLED, exit 1; `inFlightGroup` control passes |\n83|| M22: `scopeMatches` skips host check | same-path foreign-host members only | `reviewerForeignServerIdentityCannotAuthorizeLabels` (2 issues: PUT sent, no failure), `verifiedLocalAgentIDRefusesEachMismatchClass` (2 issues) | KILLED, exit 1; `orgWizardEndToEnd` same-server control passes |\n84|| M23: `verifiedLocalAgentID` skips work check | work-folder mismatch members only | `reviewerChangedWorkFolderCannotReuseConfiguredSuccess` (2 issues: registered emitted), `runConfigRefusesWorkFolderMismatchOnResume` (1 issue), pin (2 issues) | KILLED, exit 1; `serviceRefusesMismatchedLocalRegistration` (name class) passes |\n85|| M24: `verifyConfiguredGroup` always returns | cross-group resume members only | `groupChangeRefusesOldConfiguredSuccess` (3 issues: registered emitted, no failure) | KILLED, exit 1; `reviewerChangedWorkFolder` + `registerIsIdempotent` controls pass |\n86|| M25: `ownershipKey` omits server | cross-server ownership reuse only | `groupOwnershipIsScopedToServer` (1 issue: enterprise load hit), `enterpriseGroupDoesNotReuseGithubOwnership` (1 issue: adopted) | KILLED, exit 1; `ownedGroupResolvesWithoutRetakeover` same-server control passes |\n87|| M26: `syncServerBinding` skips invalidation | cross-server cache reuse only | `serverChangeBetweenStepsInvalidatesGroupAndRunner` (2 issues: PUT sent, no re-resolve failure) | KILLED, exit 1; `repoAccessAppliesAndConfirmsRealIDs` same-server control passes |\n88|| M27: `shouldAbandonInFlight` identity-only | stale selection completions only | `inFlightLabelsAbandonedWhenLabelsEdited` (4 issues: PUT+applied, draft clobbered to old), `inFlightAccessAbandonedWhenRepositoriesEdited` (1 issue) | KILLED, exit 1; `nonIdentityEditDuringInstallDoesNotCancel` control passes |\n89|\n90|No survivors in M21–M27. Prior M9 (`createGroup` default true→false)\n91|survivor bound restated from v3 (unchanged code, not rerun): the default is\n92|not load-bearing, Flow passes `true` explicitly, M9b kills the call site.\n93|\n94|The source-text-token mutant rule does not apply: no gate inspects source\n95|text.\n96|\n97|## Verification commands (real exit codes, `pipefail` where piped)\n98|\n99|- `swift test --package-path Packages/RunnerControlCore` (CI gate):\n100|  **exit 0, 147 tests passed** (132 + 3 adopted + 12 new R4/directive).\n101|- `python3 -m unittest discover -s Scripts/tests` (CI gate): **exit 0,\n102|  4 tests OK**.\n103|- `xcodebuild -workspace RunnerControl.xcworkspace -scheme RunnerControl\n104|  -destination 'platform=macOS' build`: **BUILD SUCCEEDED** (exit 0).\n105|- No repo-configured lint gate (CI runs only the two test jobs above;\n106|  no `.swiftlint.yml`; default swiftlint already fails on main per v1 notes).\n107|- Generator inputs untouched: `ios-app-manager.json`, `Project.swift`,\n108|  `Workspace.swift`, `Package.swift` unmodified (no new source files added);\n109|  existing production runners untouched (all test IO under temp roots;\n110|  services never bootstrapped).\n111|\n112|## Files changed (all UNCOMMITTED in story worktree, as required)\n113|\n114|- `Packages/RunnerControlCore/Sources/RunnerRegistration+Models.swift` —\n115|  `OperationIdentity` + server normalization.\n116|- `…/RunnerRegistration+Gates.swift` — server-bound `verifiedLocalAgentID` /\n117|  `scopeMatches`, work-folder check, `identityFieldsChanged`.\n118|- `…/RunnerInstallerService.swift` — marker `serverHost`/`groupName`,\n119|  server-scoped ownership, verified `runConfig` resume,\n120|  `verifyConfiguredGroup`, server-bound install reuse.\n121|- `…/RunnerRegistration+Flow.swift` — generation abandonment on identity and\n122|  selection edits, `workingStep`, `syncServerBinding`, single-auth steps,\n123|  verified resume/labels/service.\n124|- `…/RunnerRegistration+State+Reducer.swift` — mirrored group→registration\n125|  invalidation, `draftBegan` progress clear.\n126|- `Targets/RunnerControl/Sources/RunnerRegistrationPage.swift` — working-edit\n127|  cancel hint.\n128|- `Packages/RunnerControlCore/Tests/RunnerRegistrationTests.swift` — 3\n129|  verbatim reviewer regressions + 12 R4/directive tests, latch harnesses,\n130|  `SplitExecutor` work-folder fidelity, server-scoped ownership calls.\n131|\n132|## Stated bounds (unknowns, not guesses)\n133|\n134|- Live registration smoke remains a separate delivery task; transport covered\n135|  by fakes, filesystem by temp-root fixtures with real `tar`/`shasum`/`config.sh`.\n136|- Authenticated download `sha256_checksum` availability was confirmed\n137|  nonempty for osx x64/arm64 by root read-only live API (per revision-4\n138|  contract); this run did not make live GitHub calls.\n139|- Pagination cap is 100 pages per list (fail-closed throw, never silent\n140|  partial).\n141|- Mid-step session change (identity swap between two awaits inside one step)\n142|  is bound by single-auth reuse (no mixing); an inter-step change invalidates\n143|  via `syncServerBinding` plus `.runner`/marker verification.\n144|- Ownership table stays per-Mac (`~/Library/GitHubActions/\n145|  .runnercontrol-groups.json`); two local users do not share it. Pre-revision-4\n146|  ownership entries (no server) and configured markers (no group) fail closed\n147|  toward explicit takeover/reconfiguration, never silent adoption.","final_result":true}}}
